  "texts": {
    "preamble": "Mohammad Mujeeb vs State Of Ap on 30 March, 2021 Author: R. Raghunandan Rao Bench: R. Raghunandan Rao Hon'Ble Sri Justice R. Raghunandan Rao Criminal PETITION.No.1999 of 2021 Order:",
    "facts": "The petitioners are accused in Crime No.67 of 2021 of Dachepalli Police Station, Guntur District for the offences under Sections 270, 273, 420 r/w 34 of IPC and under Sections 56, 57 (1), 63 of Food Safety and Standards Act, 2006. However, the tobacco products and the vehicle bearing No.TS 07 UJ 3309 seized from the petitioners on 10.02.2021 have not been released to them despite the fact that the criminal case itself has been [LEAKAGE_MASK]. 3. The petitioners have now approached this Court by way of this criminal petition for release of the seized tobacco products as well as the vehicle bearing No.TS 07 UJ 3309. 4.",
